00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.320
(laughing) - Today marks the start of

00:00:01.320 --> 00:00:02.460
Hispanic Heritage Month.

00:00:02.460 --> 00:00:05.280
So what does this month mean to y'all?

00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:06.113
- Means we get to celebrate.

00:00:06.113 --> 00:00:06.946
- Yeah. Yeah.

00:00:06.946 --> 00:00:09.131
- It means we get to show respect

00:00:09.131 --> 00:00:12.600
and honor people and
talk about our history

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:15.120
and our culture, and
maybe have some good food,

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:18.053
from what I hear, today
especially, we might do that later.

00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:22.020
And you know, it's a moment to like,

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:24.750
look at where we're from,
look at what we're proud of.

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:25.620
- I think the same.
- Yeah, you too?

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:26.520
- Yeah, I think the same.

00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:27.930
Family, time.

00:00:27.930 --> 00:00:29.100
You need like time for you.

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:30.717
Like, Hispanic's everything.

00:00:30.717 --> 00:00:31.740
I think it's everything.

00:00:31.740 --> 00:00:34.994
Good food, good moments.
Celebrate every day.

00:00:34.994 --> 00:00:36.360
It's our day.
- Yeah.

00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:38.160
Yeah, for sure.
- Oh, I love you.

00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:38.993
Yeah, that sounds fun.

00:00:38.993 --> 00:00:39.826
(laughter)

00:00:39.826 --> 00:00:40.659
That sounds awesome.

00:00:40.659 --> 00:00:41.492
- Your type of party.

00:00:41.492 --> 00:00:42.325
- Yeah. - Your type of party.

00:00:42.325 --> 00:00:44.020
- I was like, well,
that just sounded great.

